        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Labyrinthine Vision"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(mental, primal)\n\nThe gritblight forces disorienting visions of Ayrzul's Blistering Labyrinth into the minds of nearby creatures. All creatures in a 60-foot cone take 7d12 mental damage with a DC 33 Will save. Creatures blinded by a gritblight's Labyrinthine Vision see only endless earthen tunnels in every direction. The gritblight can't use this ability again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n- **Critical Success:** The creature is unaffected.\n- **Success:** The creature takes half damage.\n- **Failure:** The creature takes full damage and is blinded for 1 minute.\n- **Critical Failure:** The creature takes double damage and is blinded permanently."
            },
